$ mysql -ueightran_goto -p12pass34 -h vm0 aofei  < sample.sql
$ go run *.go pub

1) go to cmd's maxmind, rpub, and redis to run one-time static mappings and caches
2) go to cmd's nats, go build -o nats-client main.go . we will run it as a user service

~/.config/systemd/user/nats-client.service:
[Unit]
Description=nats-client service

[Service]
Type=simple
Environment=AOFEI=/srv/aofei/aofei/conf/aofei.json
ExecStart=/srv/aofei/aofei/cmd/nats/nats-client

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target

systemctl --user enable nats-client
systemctl --user start nats-client


3) go to cmd/unify, to compile, go build -o unify main.go, and run it as web + dsp bidder




